WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.930 --> 00:00:07.350
Episode 1 of The Expanse Season 5 starts with
scientists who find some mysterious new asteroids.

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:13.380
They’re excited by their discovery – but
these rocks are not a natural accident.

00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:19.530
The ship is attacked by a team led by Filip
– the son of Marco Inaros and Naomi.

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:25.300
Cause Marco and his Belter extremists have
launched asteroids to hit Earth, coated in

00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:27.640
stealth tech so they’re invisible.

00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:32.850
Looks like one of them broke up near the sun,
and these scientists detected the fragments.

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:38.230
So to keep the attack secret, Filip kills
the scientists, and blows up the evidence.

00:00:38.230 --> 00:00:42.410
One of Filip’s men gets stuck, and Filip
leaves him to die.

00:00:42.410 --> 00:00:48.020
So how will Naomi react when she learns that
her son has grown up to be a ruthless murdering

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:50.340
extremist, like his dad?

00:00:50.340 --> 00:00:55.800
And will these rocks be stopped before they
hit Earth and kill millions?

00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:58.559
This attack was foreshadowed from the start.

00:00:58.559 --> 00:01:04.040
In Season 1, Avasarala said she worries about
“people who throw rocks”.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:09.800
A Belter said a “hail of stones” “will
one day come crashing down through” Earth’s

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:11.670
“precious blue skies”.

00:01:11.670 --> 00:01:17.030
This attack expresses centuries of Belter
resentment for their oppression by the inner

00:01:17.030 --> 00:01:18.049
planets.

00:01:18.049 --> 00:01:21.650
On Tycho Station, the Rocinante’s in for
repairs.

00:01:21.650 --> 00:01:27.020
The new chief engineer, Sakai, says the ship
is badly damaged, partly because they used

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:29.470
a rail gun as a thruster last season.

00:01:29.470 --> 00:01:34.620
But she says the Roci was built strong by
the “dusters”.

00:01:34.620 --> 00:01:39.220
Duster is a slang term for ‘Martian’ used
by Belters and Earthers.

00:01:39.220 --> 00:01:44.520
Just as Belters are called “skinnies”,
and in the books Earthers are called “squats”.

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:49.740
But one of Naomi’s best friends is Martian,
and she asks Sakai not to use this derogatory

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:50.750
slur.

00:01:50.750 --> 00:01:55.220
In Book 3, Anna says that these kinds of words
are dehumanising.

00:01:55.220 --> 00:02:00.790
When groups think of each other as dusters
and skinnies instead of as people, it justifies

00:02:00.790 --> 00:02:03.320
cruelty and conflict.

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:09.149
These tribal factional divisions and their
terrible consequences are what this show is

00:02:09.149 --> 00:02:11.170
all about.

00:02:11.170 --> 00:02:15.650
Way back in Season 1, Naomi asked Fred to
help her find Filip.

00:02:15.650 --> 00:02:22.220
Now he delivers, and for the first time in
years, Naomi sees her son’s face.

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:26.329
Naomi left Marco cause she didn’t want to
be involved in his terrorism.

00:02:26.329 --> 00:02:30.620
But she always felt guilt that she couldn’t
take Filip with her.

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:34.519
Now might be her chance to save her son.

00:02:34.519 --> 00:02:39.370
On the news, people are flooding through the
Ring gates to colonise the new worlds beyond.

00:02:39.370 --> 00:02:45.040
That’s thanks to Nancy Gao, the new Secretary-General
of the United Nations, who beat Avasarala

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:48.969
in the election by arguing for faster expansion
to the new worlds.

00:02:48.969 --> 00:02:53.779
Avasarala argued that it’s too dangerous
for people to settle these distant unknown

00:02:53.779 --> 00:03:00.180
planets full of dangerous alien technology
– like, Ilus almost blew up, the Ring almost

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:04.090
wiped out the solar system, Eros almost destroyed
Earth.

00:03:04.090 --> 00:03:08.360
And they’re already finding more protomolecule
structures on these new worlds.

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:13.430
So are the rewards worth the risk?

00:03:13.430 --> 00:03:17.079
Holden sees Monica, the journalist from Season
3.

00:03:17.079 --> 00:03:21.389
She’s investigating reports that someone
in the Belt is secretly experimenting with

00:03:21.389 --> 00:03:23.029
the protomolecule.

00:03:23.029 --> 00:03:27.900
In Season 2, Dresden and Cortázar said the
protomolecule has the potential to transform

00:03:27.900 --> 00:03:29.189
and empower humanity.

00:03:29.189 --> 00:03:32.890
But it also could destroy us.

00:03:32.890 --> 00:03:38.620
Monica says Holden has a responsibility to
protect the world from alien threats – but

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:41.529
Holden refuses her and leaves.

00:03:41.529 --> 00:03:46.400
Holden constantly wrestles with feeling responsible
to save the world.

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:52.180
Time and time again he tries to let go of
leadership and heroism , but every time, he

00:03:52.180 --> 00:03:58.680
comes back – Holden can’t stop himself
from saving people . It’s how he was raised,

00:03:58.680 --> 00:04:00.799
it’s who he is.

00:04:00.799 --> 00:04:06.430
Fred Johnson admits to Holden that he and
the OPA are experimenting with the protomolecule.

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:11.489
Holden says it’s too dangerous, and brings
up the artifact on Ilus.

00:04:11.489 --> 00:04:15.979
The protomolecule and the Ring were created
by an alien civilisation called the Builders,

00:04:15.979 --> 00:04:21.850
but some other entities killed the Builders
using these artifacts.

00:04:21.850 --> 00:04:27.879
Elvi is studying the artifact, and she says
it seems connected to human consciousness.

00:04:27.879 --> 00:04:32.790
Holden has a special connection to the alien
technology thanks to the ghost of Miller.

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:37.140
So when Holden goes through the Ring, he sees
these entities.

00:04:37.140 --> 00:04:42.900
It looks like they exist in like the warp
space between the wormholes of the Ring.

00:04:42.900 --> 00:04:47.830
On Fred’s table, there’s a tesseract or
four-dimensional cube, which might hint that

00:04:47.830 --> 00:04:51.120
these entities are somehow inter-dimensional.

00:04:51.120 --> 00:04:56.370
Whatever they are, Holden says they’re angry,
and he fears that messing with alien technology

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:58.689
could wipe out humanity.

00:04:58.689 --> 00:05:03.361
Fred says it’s probably fine bro and that
Holden should relax, go build a farm, take

00:05:03.361 --> 00:05:09.070
up yoga, cause if Holden’s always worrying
about death and destruction, is he really

00:05:09.070 --> 00:05:10.860
living?

00:05:10.860 --> 00:05:15.949
On Mars, Bobbie investigates a conspiracy
– she believes that powerful people in the

00:05:15.949 --> 00:05:18.990
Martian military are selling weapons to the
Belt.

00:05:18.990 --> 00:05:22.520
Avasarala is funding her investigation.

00:05:22.520 --> 00:05:25.169
Then Bobbie gets a message from Katlin.

00:05:25.169 --> 00:05:30.220
Katlin was the wife of Esai, who trafficked
stolen Martian tech last season.

00:05:30.220 --> 00:05:35.000
He did this in the hope of providing a better
life for his wife and children, like a Martian

00:05:35.000 --> 00:05:36.050
Walter White.

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:42.159
But this conspiracy was bigger and more dangerous
than he realised, and Esai was killed.

00:05:42.159 --> 00:05:46.759
So now Bobbie helps Esai’s family by giving
them money for a new life beyond the Ring

00:05:46.759 --> 00:05:49.919
– maybe she uses Avasarala’s money.

00:05:49.919 --> 00:05:55.689
So this is a kind and generous act by Bobbie
to fulfil Esai’s dying wish.

00:05:55.689 --> 00:06:01.199
Hopefully the world that Esai’s family go
to is safer than Ilus was.

00:06:01.199 --> 00:06:06.759
Alex flies to Mars in the Razorback – this
was Julie Mao’s racing ship, that Bobbie

00:06:06.759 --> 00:06:08.909
and Avasarala once used.

00:06:08.909 --> 00:06:13.750
When Alex was in the Mars Navy, they said
he didn’t have what it takes to fly their

00:06:13.750 --> 00:06:15.030
best ships.

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:20.090
So now, Alex comes back and shows off his
sweet ride to the people who said he wasn’t

00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:21.090
good enough.

00:06:21.090 --> 00:06:26.419
He’s back on Mars to try to reconnect with
his ex-wife Talissa, and his son, Melas.

00:06:26.419 --> 00:06:32.090
Alex had left his family behind to go be a
pilot – for a while, they thought he was

00:06:32.090 --> 00:06:33.090
dead.

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:39.840
Alex said he loves Talissa and Melas, but
feels that flying on the Roci, and doing good,

00:06:39.840 --> 00:06:42.340
is more important to him.

00:06:42.340 --> 00:06:47.499
But last season, Alex met Lucia, and saw her
struggle to keep her family together.

00:06:47.499 --> 00:06:51.419
So now Alex wants make peace with his own
family.

00:06:51.419 --> 00:06:56.639
He visits Talissa, and tries to apologise,
but she doesn’t wanna hear it.

00:06:56.639 --> 00:07:00.940
He was gone for too long, she’s moved on,
and she doesn’t want to deal with him.

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:06.139
So he calls his son Melas, and tries to be
a Dad, he says “I love you” – but his

00:07:06.139 --> 00:07:09.219
son doesn’t say “I love you” back.

00:07:09.219 --> 00:07:13.370
So Alex does what anyone would do, and starts
drinking.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:20.060
The bar has a Texan cowboy theme – they
play country and western music sung in Chinese.

00:07:20.060 --> 00:07:24.870
Because many of the original settlers of the
Mariner Valley on Mars were from China, East

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:29.409
India and Texas – and clearly the Texan
aesthetic stuck.

00:07:29.409 --> 00:07:33.229
Alex meets with Bobbie, but she’s not in
the mood to hang out.

00:07:33.229 --> 00:07:39.099
She’s.. preoccupied with the massive military
conspiracy thing, and she talks about the

00:07:39.099 --> 00:07:41.569
dying dream of Mars.

00:07:41.569 --> 00:07:46.930
Now that the Ring is open, people are leaving
Mars to go colonise new worlds, unemployment

00:07:46.930 --> 00:07:50.280
is rising, it’s like the planet is dying.

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:53.460
In the book, they call it a “Ghost world”.

00:07:53.460 --> 00:07:58.430
Alex talks about persisting to reconnect with
Talissa and Melas, but Bobbie says he’s

00:07:58.430 --> 00:08:00.090
gotta let it go.

00:08:00.090 --> 00:08:03.400
Maybe Alex needs a new purpose, a new home.

00:08:03.400 --> 00:08:05.949
Maybe every Martian does.

00:08:05.949 --> 00:08:07.979
Amos takes a ship towards Earth.

00:08:07.979 --> 00:08:13.059
He’s going to Baltimore, because a woman
he knew there called Lydia has died – we

00:08:13.059 --> 00:08:16.120
saw him looking up Lydia in Season 2.

00:08:16.120 --> 00:08:20.591
On the ship, he looks meaningfully at this
sleeping older woman – she’s about the

00:08:20.591 --> 00:08:23.090
same age that Lydia would be now.

00:08:23.090 --> 00:08:27.229
The show hasn’t revealed anything about
Lydia yet – just that she’s someone who

00:08:27.229 --> 00:08:29.949
looked after Amos when he was younger.

00:08:29.949 --> 00:08:33.540
Some thugs try to shake down the ship’s
passengers for money.

00:08:33.540 --> 00:08:36.190
So Amos threatens violence.

00:08:36.190 --> 00:08:40.409
He talks about how he can hold his breath
for a long time, because on these ships, if

00:08:40.409 --> 00:08:44.550
there’s a fight, the crew uses knockout
gas to put everyone down.

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:49.380
Amos is saying that if they get gassed, he’ll
just hold his breath and beat up these thugs

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:50.800
anyway.

00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:56.170
The passengers say Amos shouldn’t have antagonised
those guys – they would rather pay the protection

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:58.250
money than risk violence.

00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:00.089
Amos put them in danger.

00:09:00.089 --> 00:09:05.520
That’s the thing about Amos and violence
– he says that it’s pragmatic, that he’s

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:07.730
solving problems and surviving.

00:09:07.730 --> 00:09:13.570
But sometimes, Amos just gets people hurt,
including his friends, and himself.

00:09:13.570 --> 00:09:19.990
He goes and beats up the thugs with his fists
and feet and a toothbrush, then in the shower,

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:27.600
he looks hurt but cleansed, there’s dark
organ music playing like some ominous church.

00:09:27.600 --> 00:09:33.130
Amos didn’t fight these guys to protect
the passengers, he says he did it for himself.

00:09:33.130 --> 00:09:38.440
At this point in the book, Amos feels physically
unwell, and he thinks he’s getting sick.

00:09:38.440 --> 00:09:45.550
What’s really happening is he’s grieving
Lydia, but Amos is so repressed and detached

00:09:45.550 --> 00:09:49.070
from his emotions that he can’t directly
feel them.

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:52.970
His emotions just come out through his body,
and through violence.

00:09:52.970 --> 00:09:57.790
The only way he knows how to feel better is
to hurt people.

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:00.880
On the way to Earth, Amos is intercepted by
Avasarala.

00:10:00.880 --> 00:10:04.610
She mentions the time that Amos taught her
how to walk in mag boots.

00:10:04.610 --> 00:10:10.070
Amos had said it’s like walking in pumps,
like high heels, and she asked why he knows

00:10:10.070 --> 00:10:14.649
what that’s like and he said he “didn't
always work in space”.

00:10:14.649 --> 00:10:19.779
It sounds like just a funny lil throwaway
line, but it actually hints at Amos’ traumatic

00:10:19.779 --> 00:10:20.779
past.

00:10:20.779 --> 00:10:24.560
He’s mentioned before that he grew up around
brothels.

00:10:24.560 --> 00:10:29.089
He says he’s known paedophiles, and people
who exploit children.

00:10:29.089 --> 00:10:32.790
And that when he was five, he lived in a basement.

00:10:32.790 --> 00:10:36.690
Amos suffered a horrific traumatic childhood.

00:10:36.690 --> 00:10:43.190
Returning to Baltimore means facing the past,
and reflecting on the man he became.

00:10:43.190 --> 00:10:45.720
Avasarala sends Amos on his way.

00:10:45.720 --> 00:10:50.600
Since Nancy Gao became Secretary-General,
Avasarala is still in government, but not

00:10:50.600 --> 00:10:53.130
as powerful as she once was.

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:58.320
This guy Admiral Delgado brings her evidence
that Marco destroyed that science ship earlier.

00:10:58.320 --> 00:11:00.790
But they don’t know why.

00:11:00.790 --> 00:11:04.440
Will Avasarala find out Marco’s plan before
the rocks hits Earth?

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:05.440
The scientists who saw the rocks mention checking
their data with scientists on Luna – where

00:11:05.440 --> 00:11:06.440
Avasarala is now – so maybe that’s how
Avasarala will find out about the asteroids.

00:11:06.440 --> 00:11:09.459
Avasarala’s main goal has always been to
protect her home.

00:11:09.459 --> 00:11:13.740
And Marco’s attack threatens everything
she’s fought for.

00:11:13.740 --> 00:11:16.770
Naomi tells Holden that she’s found her
son Filip.

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:21.510
She’s going to go see him, try to save him,
and she’s going alone.

00:11:21.510 --> 00:11:29.910
Cause this’ll be a delicate and dangerous
and personal reunion, with a Belter extremist.

00:11:29.910 --> 00:11:35.430
Bringing Holden would only complicate the
situation – he’s a famous Earther hero

00:11:35.430 --> 00:11:41.449
who’s completely unable to not get involved
in things, so she leaves him behind.

00:11:41.449 --> 00:11:46.160
In Season 3, Naomi told Holden that she won’t
leave him again, that they’re “Together

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:47.380
till the end”.

00:11:47.380 --> 00:11:53.370
But like Alex and Amos, Naomi needs to face
her past, alone.

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:57.930
And with all his crew gone, Holden is alone
too.

00:11:57.930 --> 00:11:59.700
Holden grew up with eight parents.

00:11:59.700 --> 00:12:04.730
He’s always been around family and friends
in the Navy and the Cant and the Roci.

00:12:04.730 --> 00:12:09.970
Now, he’s “truly alone for the first time
in years”.

00:12:09.970 --> 00:12:12.540
The title of this episode is Exodus.

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:18.100
It refers to the flood of colonists leaving
their homes for new worlds, and it refers

00:12:18.100 --> 00:12:23.060
to Alex and Amos and Naomi leaving the Roci
for their own quests.

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:29.259
What trials and tribulations will they face,
and how will they be changed?

00:12:29.259 --> 00:12:31.990
